uments":{"content":"- [x] Find Exchange Stabilization Fund data in Treasury Bulletin documents\n- [x] Extract total nominal assets (in thousands of USD) for June 30, 1995\n- [x] Extract total nominal assets (in thousands of USD) for June 30, 1996\n- [x] Calculate absolute relative difference in percentage\n- [x] Round to two decimal places\n- [x] Write answer to /app/answer.txt"}}},"_meta":{"goose_extension":"todo"}}],"metadata":{"userVisible":true,"agentVisible":true}}}
